Description: Beta 2.6 keeps Liquid Glass baselines locked and makes the independent Clear strength a high-authority blur control for opened folders: low values stay light, while the middle/high range expands very strongly up to a 40 pt opened-panel ceiling over SpringBoard's existing blur. Wallpaper remains the only chroma source; dark/light mode only changes neutral compensation.
